    <description>Owner: Vantage Sales Systems · Tested: see Flow_Tests/ · Routes new leads (and queued leads whose Region/Segment change) to the SDR queue for their region and segment via VantageLeadRoutingService.resolveQueue. Manual leads owned by a user are left alone.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>Lead Routing {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Lead Routing</label>
